#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/grain_and_noise/dust.rst:43
msgid ""
"This effect/filter makes random dust particles appear across the image "
"source. This gives the video an old film look. See also the :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm`, :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/grain_and_noise/filmgrain`, and :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/grain_and_noise/scratchlines` effects."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter spôsobí, že naprieč zdrojom obrázka sa objavujú náhodné "
"prachové čiastočky. Dáva videu vzhľad starého filmu. Pozri tiež efekty :doc:"
"`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm`, :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/grain_and_noise/filmgrain` a :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/grain_and_noise/scratchlines`."

